    "91,130": {"title":"BLOCKERS","text":"Occasionally during Exo-Engineering tasks, the L.S.V Mare runs through a field of space debrie! \n\nDon't fret, though, all exo-engineering suits come equipped with Momentary Blockers, which can be installed here if not already done. \n\nBlockers allow you to shrug off incoming damage for a period of time!\n\nEnjoy, from Exo-Engineering, with love.\n","desktop":false,"files":[],"card":"","cardsub":"","circuit":""},
