    "89,131": {"title":"","text":"","desktop":true,"files":[{"kind":"doc","name":"SECURITY WARNING","folder":"","pass":"","targets":[],"text":"WARNING!\nWARNING!\n\nSPECTRE UNIT DAMAGED.\nALLIGNMENT PROTOCOLS...\nERROR."},{"kind":"doc","name":"Tram Requirements","folder":"NIGHT SHIFT","pass":"","targets":[],"text":"Noticed the tram down to  the roof of Security was drawing tons of power while idle, so I pulled the fuse. \n\nWell... a lot of fuses.\n\nFirst you got to get the fuse in the fuse shack, easy enough, plug it into fusebox for the tram leading to the other half of the array, grab the fuse there, plug it into the fusebox back here for the tram leading to the Exo-Engineering depot, grab the fuse there, and then...\n\nWhat was that? "},{"kind":"app","name":"TRAM TO SEC","folder":"","pass":"","targets":[{"x":91,"y":45}],"text":""}],"card":"","cardsub":"","circuit":""},
